  m_text: "Helheim, the realm of the dead, is ruled by the goddess Hel. Located in
    the depths of the world, it is a cold and desolate place where souls not chosen
    for Valhalla reside. \nHelheim is guarded by the fierce dog Garm, ensuring no
    soul escapes. This realm represents the final resting place for those who died
    of sickness or old age."
