  m_text: 'In the fiery realm of Muspelheim, a nameless being encounters fire giants
    harnessing the power of flames and magma.

    Inspired by their might, they
    learn to command fire, shaping it into weapons and fortresses. Guided by the
    giants, they master the art of wielding heat and destruction.'
