      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In the rugged landscapes of Jotunheim, the nameless being encounters a
    clan of frost giants struggling to rebuild their ancient strongholds in the wake
    of Ragnarok. Drawn to their determination, they tap into the power of ice, learning
    to shape glaciers and frost into towering spires and impregnable fortresses.
    With each structure they raise, they feel the chill of their heritage mingling
    with the warmth of their inner fire, their mastery over ice becoming a formidable
    tool in their arsenal.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 81cc66dda6eef5e4d9c0a1dec8c47766, type: 2}
